  "summary": "Malicious code in olympe-casino (npm)",
  "details": "Olympe-casino@1.0.0 is an inert SEO-spam package: its only code is an empty module (`module.exports = {}`), and the package ships a French-language README promoting the \"Olympe Casino\" online gambling site (olympecasinofrance[.]fr) with Neteller deposit/withdrawal affiliate content and an image hosted on i[.]ibb[.]co. It has no functional code, no install hooks, and no dependencies. The package is a casino-affiliate marketing artifact rather than a technical supply-chain payload.",
